== the food bank's open door
tier: decision
cast_want: decide
sphere: care
stages: adult mature elder
age: 25-90
tone: mixed
life: community, money
horizon: years
roles: colleague, neighbour, rival
earth: the food bank {N} helped grow has outgrown its room, and {N}'s word settles what it becomes
scene: The food bank that {N} helped grow now feeds four hundred households a month, and it has outgrown its back room. A supermarket chain has offered a warehouse and a van; the volunteers want to keep it small and close; the council asks why it has no forms. {N} is the one whose word settles it.
- W | open to anyone who comes, with no forms and no questions | v: universalism, benevolence | scope: place | chance: 70
