- G | run it from the community halls, with neighbours cooking and serving | v: benevolence, tradition | scope: town_sphere | chance: 65
works: The food bank finds its feet in its new shape, and the queue moves faster than it ever did.
works: {colleague} says it is the first time in years the volunteers have all pulled the same way.
fails: Some of the old volunteers walk away, unhappy with the change, and the Saturdays are short of hands.
fails: {rival} on the council questions the whole arrangement, and the paperwork piles up for months.

== the reform of care for the old
tier: decision
cast_want: decide
sphere: care
stages: adult mature elder
age: 30-90
tone: mixed
life: health, community
