earth: the country is arguing about how to pay for the care of old people, and the government's commission asks {N} to speak
scene: The country is arguing about how to pay for the care of old people, and the government's commission wants to hear from those who have run it. {N} is one of the names it asked. The town's own care homes, waiting for whatever comes, want to know which way {N} will speak.
- W | back a law that pays every care home the same rate for every resident | v: universalism, security | scope: nation | chance: 45
